@page
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8" /><title>VulnApp</title></head>
<body>
  <h1>VulnApp</h1>
  <p style="color:#b00;font-weight:bold">
    WARNING: intentionally vulnerable training application. Run locally or in CI only. Never deploy.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/Search?q=hello">/Search?q=</a> — reflected XSS (CWE-79)</li>
    <li><a href="/api/users?name=alice">/api/users?name=</a> — SQL injection (CWE-89)</li>
    <li><a href="/api/ping?host=127.0.0.1">/api/ping?host=</a> — command injection (CWE-78)</li>
    <li><a href="/api/files?name=readme.txt">/api/files?name=</a> — path traversal (CWE-22)</li>
    <li>POST /api/import — insecure deserialization (CWE-502)</li>
    <li>POST /api/register — MD5 password hashing (CWE-327)</li>
    <li><a href="/api/fetch?url=https://example.com">/api/fetch?url=</a> — SSRF (CWE-918)</li>
    <li><a href="/login?returnUrl=/">/login?returnUrl=</a> — open redirect (CWE-601)</li>
    <li><a href="/openapi/v1.json">/openapi/v1.json</a> — OpenAPI document (used by ZAP)</li>
  </ul>
</body>
</html>
